# student_sim_stability — entire results/ tree is HuggingFace-hosted (like
# data/). Both raw artifacts (conversations, probes, judge inputs/outputs)
# and aggregated outputs (evaluations, report, human_alignment, snapshots)
# live there; none are tracked in git so the repo stays small.
